Model chain:

The real ASR path loads `mlx-community/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3`, pinned at revision
`ed2b7e8c15f9aaa0b5772e2efb986255eaef7e15` and licensed CC-BY-4.0
(https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3). Its `base_model` is
`nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3`, also CC-BY-4.0
(https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3). Weights are downloaded and
cached at runtime on first use; they are not bundled with the app or committed to
this repository.

KeyboardShortcuts 2.x was evaluated for v0 but is not linked in this build because the available Command Line Tools cannot compile its SwiftUI preview macros. The app currently uses a small first-party Carbon hotkey binder.
